                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="16" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:21,965</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:24,329</end-time>
                <translation>这个月介绍的《叹异抄》
今月ご紹介している歎異抄</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="17" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:24,329</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:26,175</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 上一回感觉如何？</translation>
                <original>伊集院さん前回はいかがでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="18" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:26,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:28,534</end-time>
                <translation>总觉得“不能这样做哦”</translation>
                <original>なんかこれしちゃダメですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="19" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:28,534</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:29,850</end-time>
                <translation>“那这样做就可以吗”</translation>
                <original>じゃあこうすればいいんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="20" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:29,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:32,750</end-time>
                <translation>“不过那样做过头了也不行”的反复</translation>
                <original>まあそれも行き過ぎるとダメの繰り返しが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="21" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:32,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:34,473</end-time>
                <translation>感觉有点模模糊糊地</translation>
                <original>なんかこうふわっとした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="22" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:34,473</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:36,625</end-time>
                <translation>在我心中稍微收束成了一个形状</translation>
                <original>僕の中での形にちょっと収まってきたので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="23" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:36,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:37,675</end-time>
                <translation>那就一起收个尾吧</translation>
                <original>収めていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="24" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:37,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:40,279</end-time>
                <translation>-是的 今天想收个好尾呢 都第四夜了 -好的</translation>
                <original>-はい今日収めたいですね第4夜ですからね　-はい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="25" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:40,279</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:44,060</end-time>
                <translation>释老师 《叹异抄》终于到最后一回了
釈いよいよ歎異抄今回が最終回ですが</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="26" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:44,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:44,500</end-time>
                <translation>是啊</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="27" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:44,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:46,575</end-time>
                <translation>那么今天我们要从哪里看起呢？呢？</translation>
                <original>はいどのところを今日は見ていきましょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="28" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:46,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:53,800</end-time>
                <translation>做问卷调查的话 好像有60%的日本人会表明自己是无宗教</translation>
                <original>アンケートを取ると日本人の60%が無宗教だというふうに表明するらしくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="29" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:53,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:57,075</end-time>
                <translation>这在发达国家中也是格外多的</translation>
                <original>これは割と先進国でも突出して多い</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="30" time="">
                <start-time>00:01:57,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:01,950</end-time>
                <translation>大概那意思是“我不是特定教团的信徒”</translation>
                <original>おそらくそれは特定の教団の信者じゃありませんとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="31" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:01,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:04,836</end-time>
                <translation>“我并不相信特定的神或佛”</translation>
                <original>特定の神や仏を信じているわけじゃありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="32" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:04,836</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:07,773</end-time>
                <translation>- 大概是这个含义上的“无宗教” - 嗯</translation>
                <original>-という意味の無宗教かというふうに思うんです　-はい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="33" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:07,773</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:11,275</end-time>
                <translation>但是 比如说旧人偶会让人觉得有点害怕</translation>
                <original>でも例えば古いお人形はちょっと怖いとかですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="34" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:11,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:14,075</end-time>
                <translation>觉得是不是和逝去的人还有联系</translation>
                <original>亡くなった人ともつながっているんじゃないかとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="35" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:14,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:16,150</end-time>
                <translation>或者在厄年去驱邪消灾</translation>
                <original>あるいは厄年にお祓いをするとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="36" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:16,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:18,900</end-time>
                <translation>从广义来看</translation>
                <original>広く見ればですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="37" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:18,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,054</end-time>
                <translation>- 确实也在有意无意地进行某种宗教行为 - 嗯</translation>
                <original>-何らかの宗教行為を意図なんでいることも確かなんですね　-はい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="38" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:22,054</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:24,140</end-time>
                <translation>我在这档节目里也多次说过</translation>
                <original>僕は何度もこの番組でも言うように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="39" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:24,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:26,850</end-time>
                <translation>虽然总说自己没有宗教信仰</translation>
                <original>無宗教だ無宗教だと言うんですけど</original>
