            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="40" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:26,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:30,450</end-time>
                <translation>但要说能不能穿着鞋踩饭团</translation>
                <original>おにぎりを土足で踏めるかというと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="41" time="">
                <start-time>00:02:30,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:32,820</end-time>
