                <start-time>00:22:45,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:49,150</end-time>
                <translation>有些部分尖锐地切入宗教的本质</translation>
                <original>宗教の本質に鋭く切り込むような部分があるので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="434" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:49,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:51,275</end-time>
                <translation>所以这次我将其抽取出来</translation>
                <original>今回そこを抽出して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="435" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:51,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:54,675</end-time>
                <translation>进行了讲解</translation>
                <original>お話しさせていただいたようなことになりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="436" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:54,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:56,520</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得啊 南无阿弥陀佛</translation>
                <original>僕ねそのナムアミダブツ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="437" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:56,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:00,725</end-time>
                <translation>最后念一句南无阿弥陀佛就能得救</translation>
                <original>最後にナムアミダブツって言えば救われる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="438" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:00,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:02,220</end-time>
                <translation>这就像节目最后总结时</translation>
                <original>これ今番組最後まとめると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="439" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:02,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:04,575</end-time>
                <translation>我们会说谢谢大家一样</translation>
                <original>僕らありがとうございましたって言うじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="440" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:04,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:08,050</end-time>
                <translation>我认为这在某种意义上就像念佛一样</translation>
                <original>これってある意味お念仏みたいなもんだと僕思うんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="441" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:08,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:10,450</end-time>
                <translation>今天能够按照自己的方式</translation>
                <original>今日は自分なりにきちんと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="442" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:10,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:12,080</end-time>
                <translation>正确地理解讲述的内容</translation>
                <original>お話を理解できて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="443" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:12,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:14,750</end-time>
                <translation>并传达到每个家庭</translation>
                <original>各ご家庭にお送りすることできたみたいな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="444" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:14,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:18,809</end-time>
                <translation>希望能怀着与南无阿弥陀佛相同的心情</translation>
                <original>南無阿弥陀仏と同じ気持ちでありがとうございますを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="445" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:18,809</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:21,025</end-time>
                <translation>说出谢谢</translation>
                <original>言えたらいいと思って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="446" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:21,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:22,820</end-time>
                <translation>在最后说谢谢大家的时候</translation>
                <original>この後最後のありがとうございますに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="447" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:22,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:26,375</end-time>
                <translation>可能会让人觉得非常好笑</translation>
                <original>ねえもうあれすごくコアの笑いそうです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="448" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:26,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,480</end-time>
                <translation>可能会想“那家伙没事吧”</translation>
                <original>あいつ大丈夫だったのかっていうのになるかもしれませんけどね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="449" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:29,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:33,325</end-time>
                <translation>但我是真心想说谢谢</translation>
                <original>でもう心からありがとうございますとか言って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="450" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:33,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:34,925</end-time>
                <translation>虽然我自认为是真心的</translation>
                <original>言ったつもりだけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="451" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:34,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:37,060</end-time>
                <translation>但旁边的亲鸾会说</translation>
                <original>あとは横から親鸞という人はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="452" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:37,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:40,600</end-time>
                <translation>“你那是为了自己方便才说的吧”</translation>
                <original>それ君の都合で言うてるやろって言ってきますので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="453" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:40,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:43,945</end-time>
                <translation>那么 非常感谢释老师</translation>
                <original>それでは釈先生どうもありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" vertical="0" id="" hasRuby="0" index="454" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:43,945</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:45,440</end-time>
                <translation>谢谢大家</translation>
                <original>ありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
